  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Gondii**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Interior People**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **banter - all these presents**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Hog Calling Contest**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **banter - so random**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **banter - thanks for the shoes**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **fuck fascists**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **KingGizzard2024-11-04.KM140** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 128 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: KG [1]\n- Board positioned off-center to house left, allowing recorders a center position [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **KingGizzard2024-11-04.KM140**: taped by morst; transferred by morst; source: Neumann KM140 > Zoom F3 @32f96 [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann KM140 mics into Zoom F3 at 32-bit/96kHz ORTF pair; Transferred via Sony Sound Forge Pro and Audacity to 24-bit WAV format [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2024-11-04 Frost Amphitheater, Stanford, CA, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-november-4-2024-frost-amphitheater-stanford-ca-usa.html) [3]",
